diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 6b4f90a..67ea617 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,18 +1,69 @@
 # rpOffice — Pens · Tables · Slides
 
-Restore Privacy branded standalone programs (free with **rpOS**):
+Restore Privacy branded office suite (free with **rpOS**). Corel-style suite hub plus three pillar apps with desktop GUI.
 
-| Brand | Class | Launch |
-|-------|-------|--------|
-| **Pens** | documents | `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.pens --smoke` |
-| **Tables** | spreadsheets | `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.tables --smoke` |
-| **Slides** | presentations | `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.slides --smoke` |
+| Brand | Role | Launch |
+|-------|------|--------|
+| **Pens** | Documents | `./launchers/Pens` or `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.pens` |
+| **Tables** | Spreadsheets | `./launchers/Tables` or `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.tables` |
+| **Slides** | Presentations | `./launchers/Slides` or `python3 -m rpoffice.apps.slides` |
+| **rpOffice** | Suite hub | `./launchers/rpOffice` or `python3 -m rpoffice` |
+
+Icons: `assets/icons/{rpoffice,pens,tables,slides}.png`
 
 Not Microsoft Word / Excel / PowerPoint brand names.
 
+## Requirements
+
+- Python 3.10+ with **tkinter** (macOS: `brew install python-tk@3.14` for Homebrew Python, or use `/usr/bin/python3`)
+
+## Quick start
+
 ```bash
-python3 -m rpoffice --smoke
+cd rpOffice
+export PYTHONPATH=.
+./launchers/rpOffice          # suite hub GUI
+./launchers/Pens              # document editor
+./launchers/Tables            # spreadsheet
+./launchers/Slides            # presentations
+
+# Headless exercise (same controller path as GUI)
+python3 -m rpoffice --exercise
+python3 -m rpoffice.apps.pens --exercise
+python3 -m rpoffice.apps.tables --exercise
+python3 -m rpoffice.apps.slides --exercise
+
 python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v
 ```
 
+## Architecture
+
+- **Models** (`rpoffice.word` / `sheet` / `deck`): document truth, formulas, slide reorder
+- **Pens** expansive documents: character/paragraph formatting, named styles, page setup, headers/footers, variables, structure **codes** view
+- **Native format:** `.rPen` (ZIP package with `META-INF/rpen.json` magic + `content.json`)
+- **Interchange:** `.docx`, `.pdf`, `.txt`, `.rtf`, `.odt`, `.html`, `.md`, partial `.doc`; legacy `.json`
+- **Controllers** (`rpoffice.controllers.*`): thin edit/save/load used by GUI and `--exercise`
+- **GUI** (`rpoffice.gui.*`): Tk suite hub + three app windows with branded icons
+
+```bash
+python3 -m rpoffice.apps.pens --formats   # list open/save types
+python3 -m rpoffice.apps.pens --exercise  # formatting + .rPen + interchange
+```
+
 MIT — see LICENSE.
+
+## Pens multi-platform packages
+
+```bash
+python3 scripts/package_pens_platforms.py
+# → dist/pens/<version>/pens-*-macos.zip
+#                 pens-*-windows-x64.zip
+#                 pens-*-linux-x86_64.zip
+#                 pens-*-linux-aarch64.zip
+#                 pens-*-all-platforms.zip
+```
+
+Install (Unix): `bash install.sh` → `~/.rpos/install/bin/Pens`  
+Install (Windows): `install.ps1` or `install.cmd` → `%USERPROFILE%\.rpos\install\bin\Pens.cmd`  
+
+Requires Python 3.10+ (tkinter for GUI). Desktop only (not iOS/Android).
